WEBVTT

00:02:59.383 --> 00:03:03.860
Rồi đến Toadie, Dee Dee, Nishi,
Dignity, Coochi Snorcher,

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:08.900
Cooter, Labbe, Gladys Seagelman, VA,


00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:13.299
Wee wee, Horsespot, Nappy Dugout,


00:03:13.299 --> 00:03:19.439
Mongo, Ghoulie, Powderbox,
Mimi ở Miami,

00:03:19.439 --> 00:03:22.341
